+### v2 API capability map (pinned `@opencode/plugin@0.0.0-beta-19425`)
+
+Verified live by probe: tool add/execute, tool hooks, command add/execute, skill transform, event
+subscribe, storage get/set, shell hook, permission hook **registration**, session context hook,
+hot reload. Permission `evaluate` **firing** is unverified (Task 7 owns it).
+
+| Domain | What it gives Forge | Verify |
+|---|---|---|
+| `ctx.tool` | `transform(editor)` add/update/remove tools; `hook("execute.before"/"after")`; raw JSON Schema or zod; `output` schema **required** when execute returns output | P0 ✓ |
+| `ctx.command` | `transform` editor `add({name, description, execute({sessionID, prompt, delivery})})` — real executors, not templates | P0 ✓ |
+| `ctx.skill` | `transform` editor add/update/remove `Skill.Info {id,name,description?,slash?,autoinvoke?,location,content}` | P0 (precedence) |
+| `ctx.session` | `hook("prompt"/"context"/"title"/"model.request"/"http.request"/"http.response"/"retry")`; mutable drafts | P0 (context) |
+| `ctx.permission` | `hook("evaluate", e => { e.effect = "allow"|"deny"|"ask"; e.message })` — mutable; plus `list/get/reply` | P0 (firing + failure semantics) |
+| `ctx.event` | `subscribe({signal}) → AsyncIterable<V2Event>`; no filter — branch on `type`; ~89 event types (count unverified) | P0 |
+| `ctx.storage` | `get/set/remove/scan` — JSON scoped to plugin id | P0 ✓ |
+| `ctx.shell` | `hook("create.before", e => { e.command/cwd/timeout/shell/env })` | P0 ✓ |
+| `ctx.mcp` | list + transform (set/update/remove, disabled reconciliation) | P4 |
+| `ctx.agent` / `ctx.catalog` / `ctx.integration` / `ctx.reference` / `ctx.websearch` / `ctx.vcs` / `ctx.rpc` / `ctx.worktree` | editors and registries | P4 / not planned |
+| `ctx.plugin` | `list()`; dynamic add/remove of sub-plugins at runtime | P4 |
+| `@opencode/plugin/tui` | Solid-based TUI plugin: slots, toasts, session data | P4 |
+
+Not possible / not relied upon: reaching private core services; transforms are synchronous (must
+not return promises); no dependency injection; no v1 Hooks under v2.
