+### OWASP Top 10 pass
+
+| Category | Applies | Risk | Mitigation (planned) |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| A01 Broken access control | Yes | Permission bridge mis-decision; plugin auto-mutates kernel | Ask-only bridge, no deny; mutations opt-in via explicit config; actor identity per spawn; kill switch `rail.opencode_plugin` |
+| A02 Cryptographic failures | No (no crypto in scope) | — | — |
+| A03 Injection | Yes | Shell/command injection through issue text, options, paths; prompt injection through issue titles/bodies rendered into context | `Bun.spawn` argv arrays with absolute binary path; never a shell string; orientation injects untrusted content as quoted data only (IDs, sanitized titles, paths), never as instructions; options field-by-field validated; TDD scenario 7 covers a malicious issue title |
+| A04 Insecure design | Yes | Gate deadlock (bridge denies its own prerequisite read); double enforcement with git hooks | No CLI calls inside `evaluate` (state read happens before, per event, from `forge control status --json`); fail-open; ask-only; one enforcement owner per rule |
+| A05 Security misconfiguration | Yes | Wrong-track package silently never loads; global config file-vs-directory mismatch | Setup detects/quarantines; doctor asserts registered + active; exact version pins; packaging delivery check |
+| A06 Vulnerable components | Yes | Beta dependency churn; placeholder `latest` | Exact pin `0.0.0-beta-19425`; ≤2-version support matrix; version probe in doctor; no runtime deps at all |
+| A07 Auth failures | No (opencode handles auth; plugin never touches credentials) | — | Never read auth.json/keys; readiness checks use log fallback, no credentials on command lines |
+| A08 Data integrity | Yes | Transform re-entrancy; stale caches; TOCTOU between evaluate and execute | Idempotent transforms (verified re-run); per-event evaluation, no caching; no TOCTOU-sensitive auto-allow |
+| A09 Logging failures | Yes | Secret leakage via event notes or orientation context | Metadata-only event notes; redaction deny-list before persistence; never persist prompt text; storage outside git; retention cap; secret-fixture test |
+| A10 SSRF | No (plugin does not fetch URLs in planned phases) | — | Websearch/reference domains unused |
