+### Phase plan and gates
+
+| Phase | Outcome | Gate / falsifier |
+|---|---|---|
+| **P0** probe harness + contract lock | Scripted local probe verifies the API subset, failure visibility, permission semantics, spawn contract, skill precedence, packaging gap; `p0-findings.md` written | Any P0 check red → cut affected phase (findings decide) |
+| **P1** read-only orientation + install path | Artifact active; pointer-only orientation; read-only commands; rail registered; setup/packaging/registry/docs updated | Active envelope captured; unit + packaging tests green; no duplicate skill registration |
+| **P2** native tools + ask-only permission bridge | Read tools live; mutating tools opt-in; bridge ask-only, no CLI in evaluate, fail-open | Bridge invariants green; evaluate firing semantics from P0 honored |
+| **P3** event notes + session hooks | Metadata-only, retention-capped notes; context pointer-only; zero silent kernel writes | Redaction fixture; no prompt text persisted |
+| **P4** TUI + MCP + npm channel (opt-in) | TUI status slot; MCP transform; global npm install path | Only after P0–P3 load-bearing for a release cycle |
